---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-ink-300/30 bg-paper-alt mt-12">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 text-sm text-ink-500 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <p class="text-ink-700 font-medium">ghost-watts</p>
      <p>
        Sibling to <span class="text-ink-700">ghostwatch</span> in the civic-tech-PH arc. Code MIT. Data CC-BY-4.0.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-ink-700 font-medium">Honest limits</p>
      <p>
        Signals are correlative, aggregate to city level, not roof level. No PII, no address-level data. Methodology and caveats on
        <a href="/methodology" class="no-underline text-ink-700 hover:text-ink-900">/methodology</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-ink-700 font-medium">Found something off?</p>
      <p>
        Open an issue or PR on
        <a href="https://github.com/xmpuspus/ghost-watts" class="no-underline text-ink-700 hover:text-ink-900">GitHub</a>.
        Especially welcome: verified LGU permit data, missing franchise cities.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-3 text-xs text-ink-300 pt-4 border-t border-ink-300/20">
      &copy; {year} ghost-watts. Cite as: ghost-watts (YYYY-QN), https://github.com/xmpuspus/ghost-watts.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
